s daug žmonių. Teks palaukti maždaug penkiolika minučių. Ar tinka?","197cfbc581a2",4.45],[-1,"Sorry, we're in a hurry.","Atsiprašau, mes skubame.",1],[0,"Oh, wait, a table just opened up!","O, palaukite – ką tik atsilaisvino staliukas!","2483ce83af3b",2.52],[0,"Right this way. Here are your menus. Marco will be right with you.","Prašom čia. Štai Jūsų meniu. Marco tuoj prieis.","4c6ec589ffe7",4.34],[1,"Hi, I'm Marco, your server. How are you doing tonight?","Sveiki, aš Marco, Jūsų padavėjas. Kaip Jums sekasi šįvakar?","1ae8a5b83af2",3.33],[-2,"Fine, thank you. And you?","Gerai, ačiū. O Jums?",1],[1,"I'm great, thanks for asking!","Puikiai, ačiū, kad klausiate!","8b56f07c6e33",1.73],[1,"Would you like something to drink?","Norėtumėte ko nors atsigerti?","88bf685be069",1.39],[-2,"Can I get a tea?","Ar galiu gauti arbatą?",1],[1,"Coming right up!","Tuoj bus!","4dcd9e5b65bd",1.04],[-2,"I'm allergic to nuts.","Esu alergiškas riešutams.",1],[1,"Most of our dishes are nut-free. Only the chocolate cake has hazelnuts.","Dauguma mūsų patiekalų – be riešutų. Lazdyno riešutų yra tik šokoladiniame torte.","396a4d73c0aa",3.91],[1,"Here's your tea.","Štai Jūsų arbata.","038f24e7e936",0.79],[1,"Have you decided?","Ar jau išsirinkote?","320d07d429da",1],[-2,"Could we get the garlic bread to share?","Ar galėtume gauti česnakinę duoną pasidalinti?",1],[1,"And for your main course?","O ką imsite pagrindiniam patiekalui?","e73361f25738",1.33],[-2,"For me, the burger, please.","Man mėsainį, prašau.",1],[1,"Sounds good.","Puiku.","2c085b0b7f17",1.08],[1,"Great, it comes with a side. Would you like fries, roasted potatoes, a green salad or grilled vegetables?","Puiku, prie jo patiekiamas garnyras. Norėtumėte bulvyčių, keptų bulvių, žalių salotų ar ant grotelių keptų daržovių?","ae2d4decd050",6.93],[-2,"Grilled vegetables, please.","Ant grotelių keptas daržoves, prašau.",1],[1,"Excellent choice. It won't take long.","Puikus pasirinkimas. Tai neužtruks ilgai.","fa94454e66e4",1.92],[-2,"Hi! How are you?","Sveiki! Kaip sekasi?",1],[1,"Not bad, thanks! How are you?","Neblogai, ačiū! Kaip Jums sekasi?","90dd14681b16",2.04],[-2,"Pretty good, thanks!","Visai gerai, ačiū!",1],[1,"Nice!","Puiku!","cf0d4852aea3",1.18],[1,"Here's the garlic bread to start.","Štai česnakinė duona pradžiai.","2650d3aeac36",1.53],[1,"And here's the burger. Enjoy your meal!","O štai mėsainis. Skanaus!","0e679d312aa3",2.1],[-2,"Where's the restroom?","Kur yra tualetas?",1],[1,"It's down the hall, on the right.","Koridoriaus gale, dešinėje.","9b90df17264c",1.78],[1,"Is everything okay here?","Ar viskas gerai?","867c81167c9a",1.48],[-2,"Could we get some more bread?","Ar galėtume gauti daugiau duonos?",1],[1,"Sure! I'll bring you some more bread.","Žinoma! Atnešiu Jums daugiau duonos.","51d0a46cf61c",1.77],[-2,"Everything is delicious, thank you!","Viskas labai skanu, ačiū!",1],[1,"Would you like to see the dessert menu?","Gal norėtumėte pažiūrėti desertų meniu?","871f11323800",1.72],[-2,"Could we see the dessert menu?","Ar galėtume pažiūrėti desertų meniu?",1],[1,"We have tiramisu, chocolate cake, cheesecake, panna cotta and gelato.","Turime tiramisu, šokoladinio torto, sūrio pyrago, panakotos ir ledų.","42b0741755ac",5.99],[1,"Sure! What else can I get you?","Žinoma! Ką dar Jums atnešti?","7e69c5e47bbc",1.6],[-2,"I'll have the chocolate cake.","Imsiu šokoladinį tortą.",1],[1,"Great choice! I'll bring it right out.","Puikus pasirinkimas! Tuoj atnešiu.","9cc72178e6ff",2],[-2,"Thank you very much!","Labai ačiū!",1],[1,"You're welcome!","Prašom!","591c906e7521",0.91],[1,"Here's the chocolate cake. Enjoy!","Štai šokoladinis tortas. Skanaus!","ee28aa7581ac",2.04],[-2,"Does it have nuts?","Ar jame yra riešutų?",1],[1,"Let me check with the chef.","Tuoj pasitikslinsiu pas virėją.","f9e32898c34d",1.48],[1,"Sorry, the chocolate cake has hazelnuts.","Atsiprašau, šokoladinis tortas su lazdyno riešutais.","d381a4505cfa",2.86],[1,"Anything else I can get for you tonight?","Gal dar ko nors šįvakar?","af5fe7223118",1.63],[-2,"Could we get the chocolate cake with two spoons?","Ar galėtume gauti šokoladinį tortą su dviem šaukšteliais?",1],[-2,"How much is the steak?","Kiek kainuoja jautienos kepsnys?",1],[1,"It's thirty-two dollars.","Kainuoja 32 $.","ecb75f3b8b8a",1.62],[-2,"Thanks for your help!","Ačiū už pagalbą!",1],[1,"My pleasure!","Mielai!","fed652a688f0",0.91],[1,"Can I get you anything else?","Ar dar ko nors norėtumėte?","b8887b28a477",1.12],[-2,"Just the check, thanks.","Tik sąskaitą, ačiū.",1],[1,"Sure! I'll bring the check right over.","Žinoma! Tuoj atnešiu sąskaitą.","15a215af1393",1.9],[-2,"Do you have any vegetarian dishes?","Ar turite vegetariškų patiekalų?",1],[1,"Yes! The mushroom risotto, the pizza and the penne are all vegetarian.","Taip! Grybų rizotas, pica „Margarita“ ir penne arabiata – vegetariški patiekalai.","64a02bf78812",5.28],[1,"Here's your check.","Štai Jūsų sąskaita.","c8c5dd413cf1",0.84],[1,"Your total is forty-three dollars.","Iš viso 43 $.","c4a02bd3561d",2.7],[-2,"I'll pay in cash.","Sumokėsiu grynaisiais.",1],[1,"Great, I'll bring your change right over.","Puiku, tuoj atnešiu grąžą.","24ec04209340",2.01],[-2,"Keep the change.","Grąžos nereikia.",1],[1,"Oh, thank you! That's very generous.","O, ačiū! Labai dosnu.","ee1af21a697e",2.73],[1,"Thanks for coming! Come back soon!","Ačiū, kad atėjote! Užsukite dar!","29301b135282",2.18],[0,"Hi, welcome to Lucia's! Do you have a reservation with us tonight?","Sveiki atvykę į „Lucia's“! Ar šįvakar rezervavote pas mus staliuką?","f15929754837",4.33],[-1,"No, thanks.","Ne, ačiū.",1],[0,"How many in your party?","Keliese būsite?","ab8482553a1c",1.29],[-1,"Two, please.","Dviem, prašau.",1],[0,"It'll be about a ten-minute wait. Is that okay?","Teks palaukti maždaug dešimt minučių. Ar tinka?","e9d6ac059797",2.93],[-1,"Yes, please.","Taip, prašau.",1],[0,"Great. It won't take long.","Puiku. Tai neužtruks ilgai.","d6a8b577c680",2.17],[-1,"That's fine.","Tinka.",1],[0,"Okay, your table is ready!","Gerai, Jūsų staliukas paruoštas!","d6b21a62ac5a",1.76],[0,"Follow me, please. Here's your table. Your server will be right with you.","Sekite mane. Štai Jūsų staliukas. Padavėjas tuoj prieis.","3b76c5253915",4.95],[1,"Hi, I'm Marco. I'll be your server tonight.","Sveiki, aš Marco. Šįvakar Jus aptarnausiu.","381271dc5d6d",2.65],[-2,"Could I have an iced tea, please?","Ar galėčiau gauti ledinę arbatą?",1],[1,"Great, I'll bring that right out.","Puiku, tuoj atnešiu.","44484db0af58",1.34],[1,"Here's your iced tea.","Štai Jūsų ledinė arbata.","8ede3b061b48",0.99],[1,"Our specials tonight are the grilled salmon and a mushroom risotto.","Šįvakar siūlome ant grotelių keptą lašišą ir grybų rizotą.","dd14b8e7767b",3.92],[1,"Are you ready to order?","Ar jau išsirinkote?","eca8fb663b60",1.14],[-2,"I'll have the minestrone soup.","Imsiu minestrone sriubą.",1],[1,"And what would you like for your main course?","O ko norėtumėte pagrindiniam patiekalui?","7fc3d6ad7fca",2.24],[-2,"I think I'll go with the mushroom risotto.","Manau, rinksiuosi grybų rizotą.",1],[1,"Great! I'll send your order to the kitchen.","Puiku! Perduosiu Jūsų užsakymą į virtuvę.","38631e57bb0b",2.19],[1,"Here's the minestrone soup to start.","Štai minestrone sriuba pradžiai.","3ecfb04517e3",2.11],[1,"Here you go: the mushroom risotto. Enjoy!","Prašom: grybų rizotas. Skanaus!","0b64a0ca61b3",2.97],[1,"How's the soup?","Kaip patinka sriuba?","025507a9aa88",0.84],[-2,"Could we have a clean glass?","Ar galėtume gauti švarią stiklinę?",1],[1,"Of course! I'll bring that right over.","Žinoma! Tuoj atnešiu.","f4622e50298b",1.7],[-2,"Compliments to the chef!","Komplimentai virėjui!",1],[1,"Did you save room for dessert?","Ar dar liko vietos desertui?","82174db26dcf",1.26],[-2,"No, thanks, I'm full.","Ne, ačiū, esu sotus.",1],[1,"Alright. Just let me know when you want the check.","Gerai. Tiesiog pasakykite, kai norėsite sąskaitos.","0172bfc77442",2.5],[-2,"I'll have the cheesecake.","Imsiu sūrio pyragą.",1],[1,"Pretty